    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Khandvi"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " is a precision snack: "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "khandvi term ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "khandvi-term"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The batter uses "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "besan",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "besan"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " cooked with yoghurt until very thick. The "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "rolling test",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "rolling-test"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " tells you when the paste is ready. Spreading must happen within seconds of leaving the heat."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Prepare everything before you start cooking. Have trays oiled, spatulas ready, and someone to help spread if possible. Speed is essential once the paste is cooked."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
